WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.537
Follow-through is where a
meeting's value is kept or lost.

2
00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:08.575
Send the notes and action items in writing,
with owners and dates, the same day.

3
00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:11.449
Store them wherever the
team keeps its records,

4
00:00:11.449 --> 00:00:14.987
and make any correction visible
to everyone who attended.

5
00:00:14.987 --> 00:00:18.788
Then open the next meeting by
reviewing the previous action items.

6
00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:21.076
And avoid the meeting after the meeting.

7
00:00:21.076 --> 00:00:24.623
Decisions made in the hallway
leave out the remote attendees,

8
00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:26.362
and they never reach the notes.

9
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:30.240
To make all of this routine,
the guide gives two templates.
